# Store locator — sanctioned country blacklist

Finecoustic is US-based. **Never add stores** in blacklisted countries/regions to `templates/page.store-locator.json` (or via Theme Editor blocks). If the user requests one, **refuse**, cite OFAC + HSBC risk, and offer a non-sanctioned country instead.

**Always verify before edge cases:**
- [US OFAC Sanctions Programs](https://ofac.treasury.gov/sanctions-programs-and-country-information)
- [HSBC Sanctions Exposure Questionnaire Definitions](https://www.business.hsbc.com/en-gb/regulations/sanctions-exposure-questionnaire-definitions) — **Blocked Governments**
- [OFAC SDN Search](https://sanctionssearch.ofac.treas.gov/) — screen retailer name when in doubt

Use the **union** of both lists (strictest wins).

---

## HSBC Blocked Governments (comprehensive — never list)

Per [HSBC](https://www.business.hsbc.com/en-gb/regulations/sanctions-exposure-questionnaire-definitions):

| Country | Notes |
|---------|--------|
| **Iran** | Blocked Government |
| **Syria** | Blocked Government (HSBC — still comprehensive; do not list even if OFAC eased) |
| **North Korea (DPRK)** | Blocked Government |
| **Venezuela** | Blocked Government |
| **Cuba** | Blocked Government for US persons / US-origin business (Finecoustic qualifies) |

