## When adding a store

1. Check **country** against HSBC Blocked Governments, OFAC Tier 1, and Tier 2 — reject if matched.
2. Screen **retailer name** on [OFAC SDN Search](https://sanctionssearch.ofac.treas.gov/).
3. Sort order is automatic in `sections/store-locator.liquid` (country A→Z, then store name).

